"different areas. You can also select whether the images should be stretched "
"or scaled or centered or used as background tiles."
msgstr ""

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:70
msgid "&Background color:"
msgstr "Agtergrond kleur:"

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:75
msgid "Here you set the color in which the background of the chart is painted."
msgstr "Hier jy stel die kleur in wat die agtergrond van die kaart is gekleur."

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:81
msgid "Background wallpaper:"
msgstr "Agtergrond muurpapier:"

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:88
msgid ""
"You can select a background image from this list. Initially, the installed "
"KDE wallpapers will be offered. If you do not find what you are looking for "
"here, you can select any image file by clicking on the <i>Browse</i> button "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies 'n agtergrond beeld van hierdie lys. Aanvanklik, die "
"geïnstalleer Kde wallpapers sal wees aan bied. As Jy doen nie soek wat Jy "
"word besig om te soek vir hier, Jy kan kies enige beeld lêer deur te kliek "
"op die <i>Blaai</i> knoppie onder."

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:95
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:98
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "Blaai..."

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:99
msgid ""
"Click this button to select a background image not yet present in the list "
"above. "
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na kies 'n agtergrond beeld nie nog voordra in die lys "
"boonste. "

#: dialogs/KCConfigBackgroundPage.cc:105
